Creative Catalyst: The subculture mutated within the zero-gravity decay of a decommissioned particle accelerator turned underground nightclub.

A violent, hallucinated collision of low-slung South African log-drum swung grooves and oppressive 2000s nu-metal down-tuned drop-D riffs. Microtonal lap-slide guitars scream like tearing magnetic fields while delayed rap-metal vocals warp into reversed psychedelic echoes, creating an intoxicating, heavy-stepping kinetic trip.

